flowchart LR
    http[HTTP request]:::api
    einput[EngineInput<br/><i>PromptType</i>]:::api
    ecreq[EngineCoreRequest]:::api
    req[Request]:::core
    schedout[SchedulerOutput]:::core
    mrout[ModelRunnerOutput]:::gpu
    ecout[EngineCoreOutputs]:::core
    rout[RequestOutput]:::api
    sse[SSE chunk]:::api

    http -->|OpenAIServingChat<br/>校验/套模板/tokenize| einput
    einput -->|InputProcessor<br/>加工转换| ecreq
    ecreq -->|ZMQ 跨进程<br/>AsyncMPClient| req
    req -->|Scheduler.schedule<br/>组队·分 token·分 KV| schedout
    schedout -->|Executor → Worker<br/>GPU forward + sampling| mrout
    mrout -->|update_from_output<br/>写回状态·追加 token| ecout
    ecout -->|ZMQ 回传<br/>output_handler| rout
    rout -->|stream 生成器<br/>编码| sse

    classDef api fill:#EAF2FF,stroke:#2563EB,color:#172033
    classDef core fill:#FFF7ED,stroke:#C2410C,color:#172033
    classDef gpu fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,color:#172033
    class http,einput,ecreq,rout,sse api
    class req,schedout,ecout core
    class mrout gpu
